{"seq":3,"slug":"dart-ffi-interop","title":"FFI 与原生互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-ffi-interop","wordCount":913,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ffi-与原生互操作\">FFI 与原生互操作</h1><p><code>dart:ffi</code>（Foreign Function Interface）让 Dart 代码直接调用 C 语言动态库，无需经过平台通道（Platform Channel）的序列化开销。对于性能敏感的操作——图像处理、加密、音频解码、数据库引擎——FFI 提供了接近原生的调用速度。Dart 3.x 持续增强 FFI 能力：Native Assets（构建钩子自动编译原生代码）、<code>NativeCallable</code>（原生线程回调 Dart）、以及 <code>@Native</code> 注解（自动符号解析）大幅简化了互操作的开发体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ffi-核心概念\">FFI 核心概念</h2><p>FFI 的工作原理是建立 Dart 类型与 C 类型之间的映射：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Dart 侧&#10;        A[Dart 函数签名] --&gt; B[类型别名 typedef]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 桥接层&#10;        B --&gt; C[DynamicLibrary.lookup]&#10;        C --&gt; D[.asFunction]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph C 侧&#10;        D --&gt; E[原生函数实现]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Dart 侧\n        A[Dart 函数签名] --&gt; B[类型别名 typedef]\n    end\n    subgraph 桥接层\n        B --&gt; C[DynamicLibrary.lookup]\n        C --&gt; D[.asFunction]\n    end\n    subgraph C 侧\n        D --&gt; E[原生函数实现]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Dart FFI 类型</th>\n<th>C 类型</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>Dart 对应类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Int8</code> / <code>Uint8</code></td>\n<td><code>int8_t</code> / <code>uint8_t</code></td>\n<td>1 字节</td>\n<td><code>int</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Int32</code> / <code>Uint32</code></td>\n<td><code>int32_t</code> / <code>uint32_t</code></td>\n<td>4 字节</td>\n<td><code>int</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Int64</code> / <code>Uint64</code></td>\n<td><code>int64_t</code> / <code>uint64_t</code></td>\n<td>8 字节</td>\n<td><code>int</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Float</code></td>\n<td><code>float</code></td>\n<td>4 字节</td>\n<td><code>double</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Double</code></td>\n<td><code>double</code></td>\n<td>8 字节</td>\n<td><code>double</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Pointer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>T*</code></td>\n<td>平台相关</td>\n<td><code>Pointer&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Void</code></td>\n<td><code>void</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>void</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Bool</code></td>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>1 字节</td>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加载动态库与调用函数\">加载动态库与调用函数</h2><p>传统方式通过 <code>DynamicLibrary.open</code> 手动加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:ffi&#39;;&#10;import &#39;dart:io&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 定义 C 函数签名（原生侧）&#10;typedef SumNative = Int32 Function(Int32 a, Int32 b);&#10;// 定义 Dart 调用签名&#10;typedef SumDart = int Function(int a, int b);&#10;&#10;// 加载动态库&#10;DynamicLibrary _loadLib() {&#10;  if (Platform.isMacOS) return DynamicLibrary.open(&#39;libmath.dylib&#39;);&#10;  if (Platform.isLinux) return DynamicLibrary.open(&#39;libmath.so&#39;);&#10;  if (Platform.isWindows) return DynamicLibrary.open(&#39;math.dll&#39;);&#10;  throw UnsupportedError(&#39;Unsupported platform&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 查找并绑定函数&#10;final _lib = _loadLib();&#10;final sum = _lib.lookupFunction&lt;SumNative, SumDart&gt;(&#39;sum&#39;);&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;  print(sum(3, 4)); // 7 — 直接调用 C 函数&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:ffi';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:io';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 定义 C 函数签名（原生侧）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>typedef SumNative = Int32 Function(Int32 a, Int32 b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 定义 Dart 调用签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>typedef SumDart = int Function(int a, int b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 加载动态库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DynamicLibrary _loadLib() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (Platform.isMacOS) return DynamicLibrary.open('libmath.dylib');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (Platform.isLinux) return DynamicLibrary.open('libmath.so');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (Platform.isWindows) return DynamicLibrary.open('math.dll');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  throw UnsupportedError('Unsupported platform');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查找并绑定函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final _lib = _loadLib();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final sum = _lib.lookupFunction&#x3C;SumNative, SumDart>('sum');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  print(sum(3, 4)); // 7 — 直接调用 C 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"native-注解-声明式绑定\">@Native 注解：声明式绑定</h2><p>Dart 3.x 引入 <code>@Native</code> 注解，让 FFI 绑定更加声明式——编译器自动解析符号，无需手动 <code>dlopen</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:ffi&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 声明式绑定：编译器自动解析符号&#10;@Native&lt;Int32 Function(Int32, Int32)&gt;()&#10;external int sum(int a, int b);&#10;&#10;@Native&lt;Double Function(Double)&gt;()&#10;external double sqrt(double x);&#10;&#10;// 指定库名（当默认解析不够时）&#10;@Native&lt;Void Function(Pointer&lt;Utf8&gt;)&gt;(asset: &#39;package:mylib/src/native.dart&#39;)&#10;external void nativeLog(Pointer&lt;Utf8&gt; message);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:ffi';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 声明式绑定：编译器自动解析符号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Native&#x3C;Int32 Function(Int32, Int32)>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>external int sum(int a, int b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Native&#x3C;Double Function(Double)>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>external double sqrt(double x);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 指定库名（当默认解析不够时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Native&#x3C;Void Function(Pointer&#x3C;Utf8>)>(asset: 'package:mylib/src/native.dart')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>external void nativeLog(Pointer&#x3C;Utf8> message);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>@Native</code> 配合 Native Assets 系统使用时，编译器在构建期自动解析 Code Asset 输出的符号——完全消除运行时 <code>dlopen</code> 的平台特定逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"struct-与-union-映射\">Struct 与 Union 映射</h2><p>C 结构体和联合体在 Dart 侧通过继承 <code>Struct</code> / <code>Union</code> 来定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:ffi&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:ffi/ffi.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;// C 结构体映射&#10;final class Point extends Struct {&#10;  @Double()&#10;  external double x;&#10;&#10;  @Double()&#10;  external double y;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 嵌套结构体&#10;final class Rect extends Struct {&#10;  external Point topLeft;&#10;  external Point bottomRight;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 内联数组&#10;final class Matrix4 extends Struct {&#10;  @Array(4, 4)&#10;  external Array&lt;Array&lt;Float&gt;&gt; values;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 打包结构体（控制对齐）&#10;@Packed(1)&#10;final class PackedHeader extends Struct {&#10;  @Uint8()&#10;  external int version;&#10;&#10;  @Uint32()&#10;  external int length;&#10;&#10;  @Uint16()&#10;  external int checksum;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:ffi';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:ffi/ffi.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// C 结构体映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Point extends Struct {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Double()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external double x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Double()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external double y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 嵌套结构体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Rect extends Struct {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external Point topLeft;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external Point bottomRight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 内联数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Matrix4 extends Struct {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Array(4, 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external Array&#x3C;Array&#x3C;Float>> values;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 打包结构体（控制对齐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Packed(1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class PackedHeader extends Struct {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Uint8()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external int version;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Uint32()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external int length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @Uint16()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  external int checksum;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内存管理\">内存管理</h2><p>FFI 操作原生内存，Dart 的 GC 不管理这部分——开发者必须手动或通过 Arena/Finalizer 管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"import &#39;dart:ffi&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:ffi/ffi.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 手动分配与释放&#10;void manualMemory() {&#10;  final ptr = calloc&lt;Int32&gt;(10); // 分配 10 个 int32&#10;  try {&#10;    for (var i = 0; i &lt; 10; i++) {&#10;      ptr[i] = i * i;&#10;    }&#10;    processArray(ptr, 10);&#10;  } finally {&#10;    calloc.free(ptr); // 必须手动释放&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Arena 自动管理：作用域结束自动释放&#10;void arenaMemory() {&#10;  using((Arena arena) {&#10;    final str = &#39;Hello FFI&#39;.toNativeUtf8(allocator: arena);&#10;    final buffer = arena&lt;Uint8&gt;(1024);&#10;    final point = arena&lt;Point&gt;();&#10;    point.ref.x = 1.0;&#10;    point.ref.y = 2.0;&#10;    // arena 结束时自动释放所有分配&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// NativeFinalizer：GC 回收时自动释放原生资源&#10;final _finalizer = NativeFinalizer(&#10;  DynamicLibrary.process().lookup(&#39;free&#39;),&#10;);&#10;&#10;class NativeBuffer implements Finalizable {&#10;  final Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt; _ptr;&#10;  final int length;&#10;&#10;  NativeBuffer(this.length) : _ptr = calloc&lt;Uint8&gt;(length) {&#10;    _finalizer.attach(this, _ptr.cast(), detach: this);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void dispose() {&#10;    _finalizer.detach(this);&#10;    calloc.free(_ptr);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import 'dart:ffi';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:ffi/ffi.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 手动分配与释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void manualMemory() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final ptr = calloc&#x3C;Int32>(10); // 分配 10 个 int32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (var i = 0; i &#x3C; 10; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ptr[i] = i * i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    processArray(ptr, 10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    calloc.free(ptr); // 必须手动释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Arena 自动管理：作用域结束自动释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void arenaMemory() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  using((Arena arena) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final str = 'Hello FFI'.toNativeUtf8(allocator: arena);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final buffer = arena&#x3C;Uint8>(1024);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final point = arena&#x3C;Point>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    point.ref.x = 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    point.ref.y = 2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // arena 结束时自动释放所有分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// NativeFinalizer：GC 回收时自动释放原生资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final _finalizer = NativeFinalizer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  DynamicLibrary.process().lookup('free'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class NativeBuffer implements Finalizable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Pointer&#x3C;Uint8> _ptr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  NativeBuffer(this.length) : _ptr = calloc&#x3C;Uint8>(length) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _finalizer.attach(this, _ptr.cast(), detach: this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void dispose() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _finalizer.detach(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    calloc.free(_ptr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>内存管理策略选择：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>策略</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Arena</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>生命周期与作用域对齐</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>NativeFinalizer</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>生命周期与 Dart 对象绑定</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>手动 free</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>需要精确控制释放时机</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{策略} = \\begin{cases} \\text{Arena} &amp; \\text{生命周期与作用域对齐} \\\\ \\text{NativeFinalizer} &amp; \\text{生命周期与 Dart 对象绑定} \\\\ \\text{手动 free} &amp; \\text{需要精确控制释放时机} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">策略</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Arena</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NativeFinalizer</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">手动</span><span class=\"mord\"> free</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生命周期与作用域对齐</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生命周期与</span><span class=\"mord\"> Dart </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对象绑定</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">需要精确控制释放时机</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"nativecallable-原生代码回调-dart\">NativeCallable：原生代码回调 Dart</h2><p><code>NativeCallable</code> 让 C 代码能够回调 Dart 函数——这是实现进度回调、事件通知等模式的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// isolateLocal：只能从创建它的 Isolate 线程调用&#10;typedef ProgressNative = Void Function(Int32 current, Int32 total);&#10;&#10;void processWithProgress(Pointer&lt;Uint8&gt; data, int length) {&#10;  final callback = NativeCallable&lt;ProgressNative&gt;.isolateLocal(&#10;    (int current, int total) {&#10;      print(&#39;Progress: ${(current / total * 100).toStringAsFixed(1)}%&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  try {&#10;    // 将回调函数指针传给 C&#10;    nativeProcess(data, length, callback.nativeFunction);&#10;  } finally {&#10;    callback.close(); // 释放资源&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// isolateGroupBound：可从任意线程调用（Dart 3.x）&#10;final asyncCallback = NativeCallable&lt;Void Function(Int32)&gt;.isolateGroupBound(&#10;  (int result) {&#10;    // 即使从 C 的线程池线程调用也安全&#10;    print(&#39;Native thread completed with: $result&#39;);&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// isolateLocal：只能从创建它的 Isolate 线程调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>typedef ProgressNative = Void Function(Int32 current, Int32 total);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void processWithProgress(Pointer&#x3C;Uint8> data, int length) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final callback = NativeCallable&#x3C;ProgressNative>.isolateLocal(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (int current, int total) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      print('Progress: ${(current / total * 100).toStringAsFixed(1)}%');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 将回调函数指针传给 C</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    nativeProcess(data, length, callback.nativeFunction);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    callback.close(); // 释放资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// isolateGroupBound：可从任意线程调用（Dart 3.x）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final asyncCallback = NativeCallable&#x3C;Void Function(Int32)>.isolateGroupBound(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (int result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 即使从 C 的线程池线程调用也安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print('Native thread completed with: $result');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>NativeCallable 类型</th>\n<th>调用线程约束</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.isolateLocal</code></td>\n<td>只能从创建线程调用</td>\n<td>同步回调（进度条等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.listener</code></td>\n<td>任意线程，异步投递到事件循环</td>\n<td>异步事件通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.isolateGroupBound</code></td>\n<td>任意线程，同步执行</td>\n<td>高性能跨线程回调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"native-assets-与-build-hooks\">Native Assets 与 Build Hooks</h2><p>Flutter 3.38+ 推荐使用 Build Hooks 自动编译原生代码，无需手写平台特定构建文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// hook/build.dart — 构建钩子&#10;import &#39;package:native_toolchain_c/native_toolchain_c.dart&#39;;&#10;import &#39;package:hooks/hooks.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;void main(List&lt;String&gt; args) {&#10;  build(args, (config, output) async {&#10;    final cBuilder = CBuilder.library(&#10;      name: &#39;native_image&#39;,&#10;      assetName: &#39;package:my_package/src/native_image.dart&#39;,&#10;      sources: [&#39;src/image_processor.c&#39;],&#10;      flags: [&#39;-O2&#39;, &#39;-Wall&#39;],&#10;    );&#10;    await cBuilder.run(&#10;      buildConfig: config,&#10;      buildOutput: output,&#10;    );&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// hook/build.dart — 构建钩子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:native_toolchain_c/native_toolchain_c.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:hooks/hooks.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main(List&#x3C;String> args) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  build(args, (config, output) async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final cBuilder = CBuilder.library(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      name: 'native_image',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      assetName: 'package:my_package/src/native_image.dart',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      sources: ['src/image_processor.c'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      flags: ['-O2', '-Wall'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await cBuilder.run(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildConfig: config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      buildOutput: output,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个体系让 FFI 包的分发变得透明：<code>pub get</code> 时自动编译原生代码，消费者无需安装额外工具链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ffigen-自动生成绑定\">ffigen：自动生成绑定</h2><p><code>package:ffigen</code> 从 C 头文件自动生成 Dart 绑定代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# ffigen.yaml&#10;name: NativeBindings&#10;description: Auto-generated bindings for image_processor.h&#10;output: lib/src/bindings_generated.dart&#10;headers:&#10;  entry-points:&#10;    - src/image_processor.h&#10;  include-directives:&#10;    - src/image_processor.h\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ffigen.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NativeBindings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Auto-generated bindings for image_processor.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">lib/src/bindings_generated.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  entry-points</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">src/image_processor.h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  include-directives</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">src/image_processor.h</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行 <code>dart run ffigen</code> 会扫描头文件中的函数声明、结构体定义和枚举，生成类型安全的 Dart 绑定类。对于大型 C 库（如 SQLite、OpenSSL），ffigen 生成的绑定可达数千行——手写这些绑定既枯燥又容易出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>FFI 的价值在于绕过平台通道的序列化开销，为图像处理、加密、音频解码、数据库引擎等性能敏感场景提供接近原生的调用速度。</li>\n<li>绑定的演进路径是「手动 <code>DynamicLibrary.open</code> → <code>@Native</code> 注解声明式绑定 → Native Assets 构建期自动解析符号」。</li>\n<li>类型映射必须精确：Dart 侧用 <code>Int8</code>/<code>Uint64</code>/<code>Double</code>/<code>Pointer&lt;T&gt;</code> 等与 C 类型一一对应，结构体通过继承 <code>Struct</code>/<code>Union</code> 并用 <code>@Double()</code>/<code>@Array()</code> 等元数据标注。</li>\n<li>原生内存不受 Dart GC 管理，三种策略各有适用面：Arena 对齐作用域、NativeFinalizer 绑定 Dart 对象生命周期、手动 <code>free</code> 用于精确控制释放时机。</li>\n<li><code>NativeCallable</code> 让 C 代码回调 Dart，按线程约束选型：<code>isolateLocal</code> 同步、<code>listener</code> 异步投递、<code>isolateGroupBound</code> 任意线程同步执行。</li>\n<li>大型 C 库应交给 <code>ffigen</code> 从头文件生成绑定，手写数千行绑定既枯燥又易错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"dart-io-networking\">IO 与网络编程</a> 了解 <code>dart:io</code> 内置能力何时足够而无需 FFI，以及 <a href=\"../async-concurrency/isolate-concurrency\">Isolate 并发模型</a> 了解如何在 Isolate 中安全使用 FFI 指针。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"FFI 与原生互操作","id":"ffi-与原生互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"FFI 核心概念","id":"ffi-核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"加载动态库与调用函数","id":"加载动态库与调用函数"},{"level":2,"text":"@Native 注解：声明式绑定","id":"native-注解-声明式绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"Struct 与 Union 映射","id":"struct-与-union-映射"},{"level":2,"text":"内存管理","id":"内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"NativeCallable：原生代码回调 Dart","id":"nativecallable-原生代码回调-dart"},{"level":2,"text":"Native Assets 与 Build Hooks","id":"native-assets-与-build-hooks"},{"level":2,"text":"ffigen：自动生成绑定","id":"ffigen-自动生成绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"IO 与网络编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/core-libraries/dart-io-networking"},"next":{"title":"Pub 包管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/ecosystem/package-management-pub"}}